  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT TO DEV&apos;T OF IGAD-CEWARN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023, IGAD-CEWARN, supported by the Embassy of Ireland, expanded its 2021 climate-security study using IGAD-ICPAC&#x2019;s climate data and CEWARN&#x2019;s conflict data. The study produced evidence and four early warning reports on climate-induced conflict risks. To advance this work, IGAD is developing  a tool for early warning and conflict risk prediction and to generate best practices for climate resilience. The effort is anchored in IGAD&#x2019;s Regional Climate Security Coordination Mechanism, endorsed in 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
